ech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/DSC07826-scaled.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-37653\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/DSC07826-scaled.jpg 2560w, https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/DSC07826-300x176.jpg 300w, https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/DSC07826-1024x602.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/DSC07826-768x451.jpg 768w, https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/DSC07826-1536x902.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/DSC07826-2048x1203.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a66e407 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a66e407\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0c7151a e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"0c7151a\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0ab9786 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"0ab9786\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2b420c5 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2b420c5\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a58965e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a58965e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"l7ghb35v kjdc1dyq kmwttqpk gh25dzvf jikcssrz n3t5jt4f\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: 'Segoe UI Historic', 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #050505; font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">On the morning of November 19, the signing ceremony for a memorandum of understanding (hereinafter MOU) between Cambodia University of Technology and Science and E-GetS was held in Phnom Penh. CamTech President Prof. Dr. Khieng Sothy, Associate Vice President for Business Development Ms. Lilian Li, E-GetS Vice Presidents Mr. Zhang Juhui and Ms. Wang Huifang, student and teacher representatives, as well as local and international media attended the event. The ceremony marks the prologue of collaboration to advance the integration of higher education and the digital technology industry in Cambodia.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"l7ghb35v kjdc1dyq kmwttqpk gh25dzvf jikcssrz n3t5jt4f\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: 'Segoe UI Historic', 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #050505; font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">The workshop was held on the afternoon of June 30, 2022, with the participation of 44 teachers and students. <span style=\"font-family: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px;\">In this workshop, CamTech students also shared their learning experiences and presented various projects such as AR \/ VR Games to the students at Sovannaphumi School.<\/span><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4cffc22 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4cffc22\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2f76bf4 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"2f76bf4\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f9af37f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"f9af37f\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cbdef83 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"cbdef83\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-85de8d6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"85de8d6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/IMG_3408-scaled.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-37665\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/IMG_3408-scaled.jpg 2560w, https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/IMG_3408-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/IMG_3408-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/IMG_3408-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/IMG_3408-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/IMG_3408-2048x1365.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1ae4dea e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1ae4dea\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cdfdcd4 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"cdfdcd4\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a670a48 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a670a48\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b65125b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b65125b\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dca4db8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"dca4db8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"l7ghb35v kjdc1dyq kmwttqpk gh25dzvf jikcssrz n3t5jt4f\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: 'Segoe UI Historic', 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #050505; font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">During the event, Ms. Lilian Li outlined key initiatives under the MOU. As part of the collaboration, CamTech and E-GetS will jointly establish an employment training and internship base, designed to bridge academic knowledge with cutting-edge industry practice. Furthermore, E-GetS will offer USD 100,000 to CamTech\u2019s scholarship fund for talent development and targeted training. Ms. Li praised E-GetS\u2019s support and highlighted that these efforts will equip students with more profound professional experience, fostering new talent for Cambodia\u2019s digital transformation.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"l7ghb35v kjdc1dyq kmwttqpk gh25dzvf jikcssrz n3t5jt4f\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: 'Segoe UI Historic', 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #050505; font-size: 15px;\">\u00a0<\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-996289d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"996289d\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ee44721 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"ee44721\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b31f8ac e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b31f8ac\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\