ement-7d6dbc3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7d6dbc3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"l7ghb35v kjdc1dyq kmwttqpk gh25dzvf jikcssrz n3t5jt4f\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: 'Segoe UI Historic', 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #050505; font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><p>In his address, Mr. Zhang Juhui gave a detailed introduction to E-GetS\u2019s development history, business scope, and corporate culture. He emphasized that the company will leverage its technological and platform strengths to collaborate with CamTech in operating the training base, offering students practical opportunities, scholarships, and specialized training programs. The partnership aims to cultivate versatile talent for the digital economy and drive Cambodia\u2019s digital transformation.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-375b262 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"375b262\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b67366a e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"b67366a\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-acd6c17 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"acd6c17\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5799769 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5799769\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2ddb27a elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"2ddb27a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.defa